@Mon Thanks for the detailed investigation. Let's go with your proposed approach (handing off to Safari via openExternal) for now — it avoids the Kakao template re-registration, which works better for our timeline. We can consider the AL button approach as a follow-up improvement later.

One question: how long do you expect the fix (including real-device verification) to take? We have a new promotion launching tomorrow and will be sending the KakaoTalk message for it, so timing matters. If you need any priority adjustments on your end, please let me know.

Also, please go ahead with the remaining checks you mentioned (Associated Domains confirmation with the App team, and whether the promotional/친구톡 message links route through a Universal-Link domain).
